@startuml checkpoint_runtime
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title C11 - private supported SQLite completion transaction
start
:Bind selected master seed/model, provenance and persistent streams;
:Retain initial config / native record in the first fixed master packet;
:Compute next frozen curriculum-A STARTED descriptor;
:Durably commit STARTED / consumed cursors before launch;
:Run and independently verify whole-match ACK and stop proofs inside job;
if (Infrastructure / integrity / storage failure?) then (yes)
  :Preserve STARTED and known-prefix diagnostics;
  :Abort all masters without retry / resume;
  stop
else (no)
  :Release only owned scratch model inputs after verified close/reap;
  if (At least one verified sampled choice?) then (yes)
    :Verify one native Burn proposal against the frozen baseline/model;
    :Atomically commit model / baseline / counters / RNG / journal;
    if (Checkpoint bucket due?) then (yes)
      :Commit exact actual-epoch checkpoint and fulfilled bucket together;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Commit verified diagnostic state only;
    :No PG, L2, baseline insertion or checkpoint;
  endif
endif
:Export only selected config/native record to inference;
note right
  SQLite / JSON / method names do not establish eligibility.
  No pending-gradient checkpoint or automatic failure resume.
  Actual storage durability / fit remain separately qualified.
  C15: fifty fixed 100-slot evidence packets, no failure rollover.
end note
stop
@enduml
